--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party models and weights loaded at runtime
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The scripts in this repository download pretrained weights from the Hugging
Face Hub at run time. These weights are NOT redistributed as part of this
repository and remain subject to their own upstream licenses:

* DINOv3 (facebook/dinov3-*, Meta AI/FAIR)
  Loaded via `transformers.AutoModel` as a frozen feature extractor.
  Governed by the DINOv3 License (Meta's own custom license, not an
  OSI-approved license). See:
  https://ai.meta.com/resources/models-and-libraries/dinov3-license/
  Reference: Siméoni et al., "DINOv3," arXiv:2508.10104, 2025.

* Stable Diffusion v1.5 U-Net (runwayml/stable-diffusion-v1-5)
  Loaded via `diffusers.StableDiffusionPipeline.from_pretrained` and used
  solely as a frozen feature extractor for AI-generated image detection —
  this project does not use it to generate images. Governed by the
  CreativeML OpenRAIL-M License.
  Methodology reference: Xu et al., "Detecting Image Attribution for
  Text-to-Image Diffusion Models in RGB and Beyond," arXiv:2403.19653, 2024.

* ConvNeXt V2 (timm, ImageNet-pretrained backbone used inside F3Net)
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Methodology references (no vendored code)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

* F3Net — frequency-domain forgery cue design inspired by:
  Qian et al., "Thinking in Frequency: Face Forgery Detection by Mining
  Frequency-Aware Clues," ECCV 2020.
  The dual-stream ConvNeXt V2 architecture in this repository is an
  original implementation by Team Veritas.

Full training/dataset methodology is described in the accompanying paper,
"운용 환경을 고려한 Text-to-Image 생성 이미지 판별 프레임워크."
